# GEMINI.md

> Gemini CLI specific configuration | Extends [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)

## Model Preferences

```yaml
default: gemini-2.0-flash
complex_tasks: gemini-2.0-pro
```

## Gemini CLI Commands

```bash
# Start session with context
gemini chat --context ".ai/README.md,.specs/{service}/index.md"

# Code review
gemini review --files "src/**/*.ts"

# Generate documentation
gemini generate --template ".ai/templates/doc.md" --output "docs/"
```

## Prompt Patterns

### Starting Work
```
Context files:
- .ai/README.md
- .specs/{service}/index.md

Task: {description}
```

### Implementation Request
```
Implement {feature}.
Workflow: .ai/workflows/implementation.md
Check spec exists before coding.
```

### Code Review
```
Review the following changes:
{diff}

Checklist per .ai/workflows/review.md
```

## API Configuration (Optional)

```bash
# Set API key
export GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Or use config file
cat > ~/.gemini/config.json << EOF
{
  "apiKey": "your_key_here",
  "defaultModel": "gemini-2.0-flash"
}
EOF
```

## Integration with Claude Code

| Task | Primary | Secondary |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Complex implementation | Claude Code | - |
| Code review | Gemini CLI | Claude Code |
| Documentation | Gemini CLI | - |
| Consensus validation | Both | Compare outputs |

## Custom Instructions

Add any project-specific Gemini instructions here:

```
# Example: Focus on performance
- Prioritize performance in code suggestions
- Flag potential N+1 queries
```
